        },
        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "Trump tech and chip exemptions",
          "why": "Readers tracking crypto infrastructure — mining hardware, AI chips, semiconductor exposure — needed to know which product categories escaped the tariff net immediately after Liberation Day."
